 like one loss too many for ruth to  take for years ruth encouraged wyatt to  seek a life better than the one she  feels destined to live more than  anything she wants to see why it break  the langmore curse and escape the ozarks  once and for all sadly with a single  gunshot javi robs wyatt of his future  and ruth of any potential vicarious  happiness as she pulls out of the former  snell langmore driveway ruth drives  erratically clearly emotional over the  discovery after her original assumption  that frank cosgrove jr is to blame has  quickly proven incorrect a far more  devastating truth is revealed in spite  of all the two have done for each other  and the trust they have been probably  built marty continues to have a toxic  effect on her life in the aftermath of  her sudden realization of the real  culprits ruth returns to the birdhouse  and threatens to kill marty if he  doesn't tell her who is directly  responsible for why it's death though  jonah is quick to give up hobbies names  such knowledge seems like it will do  little to stop a coming war between ruth  and the rest of the bird family the bird  family's entire future relies on hobby's  continued breathing something ruth is  clearly unwilling to accept  though crude outbursts and high strong  emotions are somewhat typical of ruth  this encounter seems different to a  significant extent this time she really  means it  if you want to stop me you're going to  have to  kill me  the langmores and the birds have  quarreled for years resulting in a  number of deaths but the loss of wyatt  is unique with each prior loss ruth  finds a way to rationalize marty's  involvement when her uncles die ruth is  willing to set up their execution  herself when her father dies even ruth  has to admit that he was not a good  person and while ben's death was  certainly the most difficult for her to  accept ruth always seems to blame wendy  more than marty in this case there is no  separating marty's involvement with a  cartel from wyatt's death and javi's  continued protection worse yet ruth now  has nothing left to lose  check out one of our newest videos right  here plus even more looper videos about  your favorite movies and tv shows are  coming soon subscribe to our youtube  channel and hit the bell so you don't  miss a single one  [Music]
 

